      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I used to play on green all of the time so my main friends could join me whenever without having to request, or just so they could see where I was at. But then I friended some people that would join me in rather inconvinent moments, like, most of my friends are very chill, but there was this annoying loud kid that would sometimes join me and ruin the mood, and I couldn't just unfriend him because he was a friend of a friend of mine, and I felt bad about doing so because he also liked me, so I began just being on orange most of the time.\n\nOverall, there are just moments were you wish to be shown as available for some, but not for others.",
